{
  "chapter_id": "09",
  "chapter_name": "購物與退稅",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "09-001",
      "en": "How much does this cost?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "cost",
          "kk": "/kɔst/",
          "zh": "成本"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "這個多少錢？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "price",
        "inquiry"
      ],
      "tips": "購物時最基本的問價句型。也可以說：What's the price of this?（這個的價格是多少？）或 How much is this?（這個多少錢？）三種都很常用。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-002",
      "en": "Do you have this in a larger size?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "larger",
          "kk": "/ˈlɑrdʒɚ/",
          "zh": "更大"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "這個有大一點的尺寸嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "size",
        "clothing"
      ],
      "tips": "尺碼詢問：larger（大一碼）、smaller（小一碼）。也可以直接說尺碼：Do you have this in a medium / large / XL?（你們有這個中/大/加大碼嗎？）",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-003",
      "en": "Can I try this on?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "try on",
          "kk": "/traɪ ɑn/",
          "zh": "試穿"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我可以試穿這件嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "fitting",
        "clothing"
      ],
      "tips": "try on 是片語動詞，意思是「試穿（衣物）」。試鞋時也用同一個片語。試穿室（fitting room）通常在店後方，可以問：Where is the fitting room?（試穿室在哪裡？）",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-004",
      "en": "Do you offer a tax refund for tourists?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "tax refund",
          "kk": "/tæks ˈriːfʌnd/",
          "zh": "退稅"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "你們有提供旅客退稅服務嗎？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "tax refund",
        "tourist"
      ],
      "tips": "tax refund（退稅）是許多國家提供給觀光客的福利，購買特定金額以上商品，離境時可以退回消費稅（VAT / GST）。需要出示護照並索取退稅單（tax refund form）。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-005",
      "en": "Where do I go to claim my tax refund at the airport?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "claim",
          "kk": "/kleɪm/",
          "zh": "宣稱"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我要在機場的哪裡辦理退稅？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "tax refund",
        "airport"
      ],
      "tips": "claim 是「申請、領取（應得的東西）」。機場退稅通常在出境安檢前的退稅窗口（VAT refund counter）辦理，需出示退稅單、購物收據、護照和商品（有時需要）。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-006",
      "en": "Could I get a receipt, please?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "receipt",
          "kk": "/rɪˈsiːt/",
          "zh": "收據"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "可以給我收據嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "receipt",
        "payment"
      ],
      "tips": "receipt（收據）的 p 不發音。退稅時必須出示購物收據，因此每次購物後一定要記得索取並妥善保存，不要丟棄。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-007",
      "en": "Is this on sale?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "on sale",
          "kk": "/ɑn seɪl/",
          "zh": "出售"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "這個有在特價嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "discount",
        "sale"
      ],
      "tips": "on sale 有兩種意思：在美式英語多指「特價、打折中」；在英式英語有時指「有在賣（販售中）」。看到 Sale 標牌通常代表有折扣。詢問折扣也可說：Is there a discount?（有折扣嗎？）",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-008",
      "en": "Can I pay by credit card?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "credit card",
          "kk": "/ˈkrɛdɪt kɑrd/",
          "zh": "信用卡"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我可以刷信用卡嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "payment",
        "credit card"
      ],
      "tips": "在詢問是否可刷卡之前，留意收銀台附近是否有 Visa、Mastercard 等貼紙，若有通常代表接受刷卡。部分小店或市場只收現金（cash only）。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-009",
      "en": "I'd like to return this item. I have the receipt.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "return",
          "kk": "/rɪˈtɜrn/",
          "zh": "返回"
        },
        {
          "word": "item",
          "kk": "/ˈaɪtəm/",
          "zh": "物品"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我想退貨，我有收據。",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "return",
        "refund"
      ],
      "tips": "return 在此作動詞，意思是「退貨」。各店家的退換貨政策（return policy）不同，有的需要在購買後 30 天內，有的需要商品未開封。購物前可以先確認 return policy。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-010",
      "en": "This item is defective. Could I exchange it?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "defective",
          "kk": "/dɪˈfɛktɪv/",
          "zh": "有缺陷的"
        },
        {
          "word": "exchange",
          "kk": "/ɪksˈtʃeɪndʒ/",
          "zh": "交換"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "這件商品有瑕疵，可以換一件嗎？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "defective",
        "exchange"
      ],
      "tips": "defective 是「有缺陷的、瑕疵品」。exchange 是「換貨」，refund 是「退款」。換貨比退款更容易被接受，如果只是想換同款無瑕疵品，先提換貨。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-011",
      "en": "Do you have this in a different color?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "color",
          "kk": "/ˈkʌlɚ/",
          "zh": "顏色"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "這個有不同顏色嗎？",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "color",
        "preference"
      ],
      "tips": "color 是美式拼法；英式英語拼作 colour。購物時常用顏色詞彙：black（黑）、white（白）、navy（深藍）、beige（米色）、burgundy（酒紅）。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-012",
      "en": "How do I fill out the tax refund form?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "fill out",
          "kk": "/fɪl aʊt/",
          "zh": "填寫"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "退稅單要怎麼填？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "tax refund",
        "form"
      ],
      "tips": "fill out 是「填寫（表格）」，也可以說 fill in。退稅單通常需要填寫：姓名、護照號碼、航班號碼、銀行帳號或信用卡號碼（用於退款）。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-013",
      "en": "I'm just browsing, thank you.",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "browsing",
          "kk": "/ˈbraʊzɪŋ/",
          "zh": "瀏覽"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我只是隨便看看，謝謝。",
      "level": "A2",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "casual",
        "response"
      ],
      "tips": "browsing 是「隨便瀏覽、隨便逛逛」。當店員上前詢問 Can I help you?（需要幫忙嗎？）而你只是想自己看看，用這句話可以禮貌地婉拒，不傷感情。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-014",
      "en": "Could you gift wrap this for me?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "gift wrap",
          "kk": "/ɡɪft ræp/",
          "zh": "禮品包裝"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "可以幫我包裝成禮物嗎？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "gift",
        "service"
      ],
      "tips": "gift wrap 是「禮品包裝」，通常需要支付少許費用或在特定店家才有提供。如果是買來送人，也可以說：It's a gift. Could you wrap it?（這是要送人的，可以包裝嗎？）",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-015",
      "en": "What is the minimum purchase amount for a tax refund?",
      "keywords": [
        {
          "word": "minimum",
          "kk": "/ˈmɪnɪməm/",
          "zh": "最低限度"
        },
        {
          "word": "purchase",
          "kk": "/ˈpɜrtʃɪs/",
          "zh": "購買"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "退稅的最低消費金額是多少？",
      "level": "B1",
      "tags": [
        "shopping",
        "tax refund",
        "amount"
      ],
      "tips": "各國退稅最低消費門檻（minimum purchase amount）不同，例如：歐盟約 €50-€175（依國家而異）、日本為 ¥5,000。購物前先查詢可以更有計畫地消費。",
      "audio": null,
      "type": "question"
    }
  ],
